<topbar title="确认视频" back bind:back="back"/><view class="page"><video class="preview" src="{{path}}" controls object-fit="contain"/><view class="between section"><text class="title">分析范围</text><text class="action" bindtap="restore">恢复完整视频</text></view><view class="row section"><view class="half"><text class="label">开始（秒）</text><input class="field" type="digit" value="{{start}}" data-key="start" bindinput="input" disabled="{{busy||locked}}"/></view><view class="half"><text class="label">结束（秒）</text><input class="field" type="digit" value="{{end}}" data-key="end" bindinput="input" disabled="{{busy||locked}}"/></view></view><view class="section"><text class="label">名称</text><input class="field" maxlength="80" value="{{name}}" data-key="name" bindinput="input" disabled="{{busy||locked}}"/></view><picker mode="date" value="{{date}}" bindchange="date" disabled="{{busy||locked}}"><view class="between section"><text>攀爬日期</text><text>{{date}} ›</text></view></picker><view class="between section" bindtap="group"><text>关联线路</text><text class="action">{{route}} ›</text></view><view class="muted section">点击“开始分析”后上传并保存。会上传源视频，并按所选范围准备播放和动作分析。</view><view wx:if="{{busy}}" class="section"><progress percent="{{progress}}" stroke-width="4" activeColor="#829C72"/><view class="muted">{{phase}} {{progress}}%</view></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error section">{{error}}</view><button class="primary section" bindtap="start" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">{{error?'重试保存':'开始分析'}}</button></view>
